  Title: '<color=#FF742D>Spooky Scavenger Hunt</color>'
  Details: We’re kicking off the Halloween Scavenger Hunt this week, and it will run until 11/4.\n\nThere are 11 spooky totems hidden throughout the game during the event! Find them all and claim a FREE accessory!\n\nHere are some hints to get you started:\n\n<color=white>-Become a mortician\n\n-Adopt a dog\n\n-Mourn the dead</color>
